""Esperaré aquí dentro al
mensajero de la Familia Real!""",NPC_DIALOGUE,LOW_RISK,oot.o2r::text/nes_message_data_static,NPC_DIALOGUE message,LOW,LOW,LOW,ACCEPT,,HIGH,
0x3018,"I'm so hungry that I can't think
about anything but food!
--- PAGE ---
Ask Big Brother about complicated
things.
--- PAGE ---
If he's in a bad mood, he'll 
probably get mad at you...it
can be pretty scary. But...
--- PAGE ---
I know his SECRET.
--- PAGE ---
He may not look like the type,
but Big Brother loves to dance!
If he gets in a rhythm, he'll surely...","Tengo tanta hambre que no
puedo pensar en nada más que
en comida.
--- PAGE ---
Pregúntale al Gran Hermano
por las cosas complicadas.
--- PAGE ---
Si está de mal humor, probable-
mente se enojará contigo... puede
ser bastante aterrador. Pero...
--- PAGE ---
Conozco su SECRETO.
--- PAGE ---
Puede que no parezca del tipo,
¡pero al Gran Hermano le encanta
