seguramente...",NPC_DIALOGUE,MEDIUM_RISK,oot.o2r::text/nes_message_data_static,NPC_DIALOGUE message,LOW,LOW,LOW,ACCEPT,,HIGH,
0x3019,"I remember Big Brother used to
