--- PAGE ---
¡Hambruna y hambre por la
escasez de piedras!
--- PAGE ---
Pero...",NPC_DIALOGUE,CRITICAL_GAMEPLAY,oot.o2r::text/nes_message_data_static,Puzzle / Dungeon / Spatial navigation hint,LOW,HIGH,LOW,ACCEPT,,HIGH,
0x301B,"This is a Goron problem!
--- PAGE ---
We don't need any help from
