¡de nuevo en algún momento!",NPC_DIALOGUE,CRITICAL_GAMEPLAY,oot.o2r::text/nes_message_data_static,Puzzle / Dungeon / Spatial navigation hint,LOW,HIGH,LOW,ACCEPT,,HIGH,
0x301F,"No matter how many times I hear 
