0x3020,"Well, that's not quite what I 
was looking for...
--- PAGE ---
I wanted to hear...a tune...
something...um...from outside 
the mountains...something...
green...natural...
--- PAGE ---
That's the kind of music I want 
to hear...","Bueno, eso no es exactamente
lo que buscaba...
