¿Quieres que lo revise por ti?",NPC_DIALOGUE,LOW_RISK,oot.o2r::text/nes_message_data_static,NPC_DIALOGUE message,LOW,LOW,LOW,ACCEPT,,HIGH,
0x5028,"I am the boss of the carpenters
that Impa hired to improve this
village and make it into a true
