¡Entra ahí y quédate callado!",NPC_DIALOGUE,LOW_RISK,oot.o2r::text/nes_message_data_static,NPC_DIALOGUE message,LOW,LOW,LOW,ACCEPT,,HIGH,
0x6007,"I have no idea where you 
come from, but you must have a
lot of guts to make it past all
